guide polestar-completionist-horde/dungeon-blackrock-spire
title Blackrock Spire (Completionist)
faction Horde
category Dungeons
levels 58-60
zone Searing Gorge
next polestar-completionist-horde/58-tirisfal-glades-and-the-undercity-5
pitch Blackrock Spire, in Searing Gorge.
why Every Horde quest of Blackrock Spire: the chains that lead to it, the pick-ups before the run and the hand-ins after it.

